    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφονδύλ-η</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>an insect which lives on the roots of plants</i>,
