			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.14.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπονδύλη:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ γαλῆ παρ᾽ Ἀττικοῖς</span>, <i><span class="en">
